reports/diagnostics/*

# Ignore bulky report outputs, but keep the narrative docs version-controlled.
# NOTE: git cannot re-include files under an excluded DIRECTORY, so the
# handover dir itself must be re-included before its contents are filtered.
reports/*
!reports/paper_outline.md
!reports/*.md
!reports/handover/
reports/handover/*
!reports/handover/*.md
!reports/handover/*.canvas.tsx
reports/handover/HANDOVER_2026-08-05.md

# The ICASSP submission. `icassp/*` alone would have excluded the paper itself
# from version control, so the sources are re-included explicitly. Keep the
# 10.7 MB provenance dump, the vendor PDFs and every build product out.
icassp/*
!icassp/paper.tex
!icassp/refs.bib
!icassp/spconf.sty
!icassp/IEEEbib.bst
!icassp/figs/
icassp/figs/*
!icassp/figs/*.pdf
!icassp/figs/*_plotted.csv
icassp/paper.pdf
icassp/*.aux
icassp/*.bbl
icassp/*.blg
icassp/*.log
icassp/*.out
icassp/*.fls
icassp/*.fdb_latexmk

# `*.csv` is excluded globally above; the figure sidecars record exactly what
# reached the axes and are small, so they are tracked deliberately.
